# Route: guide 1 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 1 to 12,
# 57 quests, 3.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Teldrassil): Dolanaar -> Starbreeze Village -> Shadowglen -> Dolanaar
# -> Ban'ethil Hollow -> Dolanaar -> Starbreeze Village -> Dolanaar ->
# Ban'ethil Hollow -> Dolanaar -> Ban'ethil Hollow -> Dolanaar -> Ban'ethil
# Hollow -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Twisted Hatred (98403; Xethorr the
# Wicked 12).
#
# Left out: Crown of the Earth (934): the route takes them here but cannot
# finish them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 1581 Elixirs
# for the Bladeleafs; 1582 Moonglow Vest; 97938 Camping 101: Alchemy; 97939
# Camping 101: Blacksmithing; 97940 Camping 101: Enchanting; 97941 Camping
# 101: Engineering; 97942 Camping 101: First Aid; 97943 Camping 101: Fishing;
# 97944 Camping 101: Herbalism; 97946 Camping 101: Leatherworking; 97948
# Camping 101: Mining; 97949 Camping 101: Skinning; 97950 Camping 101:
# Tailoring.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199).

